WEBVTT

00:35:27.384 --> 00:35:30.156
I would have said, "This is
a terrible time for me to work.

00:35:30.180 --> 00:35:31.960
What I need to be doing is grieving."

00:35:31.984 --> 00:35:34.955
But what I actually needed
to be doing was creating.

00:35:34.979 --> 00:35:38.466
The creation for me
is the antidote to despair.

00:35:38.490 --> 00:35:41.536
And as far as the idea of suffering goes,

00:35:41.560 --> 00:35:44.419
what I do know about myself
is that I am willing.

00:35:44.443 --> 00:35:47.480
The word "willing" has been ringing
through my consciousness

00:35:47.504 --> 00:35:50.091
for months now, for years.

00:35:50.115 --> 00:35:54.877
I am willing to feel
whatever needs to be felt.

00:35:54.901 --> 00:35:56.837
My friend Martha Beck says beautifully,

00:35:56.861 --> 00:36:00.883
"I will feel whatever I need to feel
to not fall into depression."